menu "AFR gauge"

    config AFR_SUPPLY_SENSE
        bool "Spartan supply sense fitted on AIN2 (47k/10k divider)"
        default n
        help
            The optional red-wire divider. With it, the gauge also uses the
            Spartan's 12 V to detect power-up (above 9 V) and loss (under
            8 V), and logs supply_v. Without it, AIN2 is not read and
            supply_v is blank.

endmenu
